Live status on the Release: cub sveltos status, run on 2026-10-09 (UTC).

Two kind clusters with stock Sveltos v1.15.0: the management cluster, which is
also the staging cluster (mgmt), and one workload cluster (prod-1). One live
profile, web (the podinfo chart), onboarded with --prefix rh-sv and handed
over. ConfigHub v0.8.10. "cub sveltos" is the released v0.13.0; "./cub-sveltos"
is this change, built from source. The workflow's prod stage requires Released
and Healthy. Lines starting "Promoting" are left out.

